{"author":"cursor[bot]","author_type":"Bot","body":"### Misleading distance display for safe negative liquidation positions\n\n**Medium Severity**\n\n\u003c!-- DESCRIPTION START --\u003e\nWhen `liquidationPrice \u003c= 0`, `liquidationDistancePercent` returns `0`, and `formatLiquidationDistance` then displays `\u003c0.1%`. This implies the position is extremely close to liquidation, but a negative liquidation price actually means the position is very safe — effectively immune to liquidation at any positive price. The real distance is conceptually infinite, not near-zero. Meanwhile, the liquidation *price* correctly shows `--`. So the user sees `--` for price but `\u003c0.1%` for distance, which sends contradictory signals and could cause unnecessary concern or unwarranted margin adjustments on a safe position.\n\u003c!-- DESCRIPTION END --\u003e\n\n\u003c!-- BUGBOT_BUG_ID: f5d67f83-67e5-417a-8876-83b6555b2e9e --\u003e\n\n\u003c!-- LOCATIONS START\nui/components/app/perps/edit-margin/edit-margin-modal-content.tsx#L214-L223\nui/hooks/perps/marginUtils.ts#L108-L111\nLOCATIONS END --\u003e\n\u003cdetails\u003e\n\u003csummary\u003eAdditional Locations (1)\u003c/summary\u003e\n\n- [`ui/hooks/perps/marginUtils.ts#L108-L111`](https://github.com/MetaMask/metamask-extension/blob/7e128c9ba987df4a5e366c414b20eca866a636b0/ui/hooks/perps/marginUtils.ts#L108-L111)\n\n\u003c/details\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://cursor.com/open?data=eyJhbGciOiJSUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCIsImtpZCI6ImJ1Z2JvdC12MiJ9..Gp4r2W6MpP7Pb272_E2D3l6cNbYICzkvLctkFYCL4O5SaTbLkBN_ZnGQR75sQoKv_oavZlvgp9-Epev9w3cbf3hAq-zc4VJ5Fx526_X04oxVvaTyZ3uWNVUMAz3gnNLEHlz5QGNP6vUqCnyvKxM9ailNeo4B59AICgtyzsS444U4K_miwRJvKBWQ7G5eOLtsQezU9Npilah-z-sEewtYSThbg9KJj0eyG-urP7k9j0AemKWB8Bsr-vxz2l0VmH_mhh_ck0a8edxbPKWpYSuNrV9VOx-8K6qK-lEs0DZw-fDmf-fuk8pb8oyGBRiwo80NhiicD17dlGI4QUQfRTx0Gw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003e\u003cpicture\u003e\u003csource media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"http